# (build 141c) With no GPU chain -- shaders/ without the CRT chain's
# compiled shaders (build 141a renamed two of them, so a tree that had not
# run `make shaders` lost the chain) -- the SDL_Renderer placeholder draws
# the flat picture and no CRT setting can show. The Escape menu says so on
# every CRT row instead of taking scanlines and masks as on. Until 141c the
# rows read as on a display that could show them (a 3840x2400 fullscreen
# panel: SCANLINES, APERTURE GRILLE with no reason) and turning them on
# changed nothing.
start new
display 3840x2400 fullscreen no-chain
wait screen title
press esc
expect escape-menu open
press down
press down
press down
press down
expect crt summary OFF
press c
press c
expect crt scanlines ON / NO CRT SHADERS
press down
press c
expect crt mask APERTURE GRILLE / NO CRT SHADERS
expect crt summary OFF
